// Tool profiles (SAD §11.5). Loaded by rmc_world::tools::ToolTable.
//
// damage:     added to the target cell's damage per swing; a cell breaks when
//             its damage reaches the material's hardness (materials.ron).
// interval_s: the shortest time between two swings, in seconds.
// reach_m:    how far from the eye a cell can be hit, in meters.
// shape:      the cells one swing damages around the hit cell:
//             Cell, or Sphere(radius: r) for every cell within r cells.
//
// tools: further profiles by key; an items.ron row names the one it
//        swings with. What a tool is fast on is in its items.ron row.
// hand:  what an empty hand, or a hand holding a material, swings with.
(
    pickaxe: (
        damage: 10,
        interval_s: 0.35,
        reach_m: 3.0,
        shape: Cell,
    ),
    tools: {
        "shovel": (damage: 20, interval_s: 0.35, reach_m: 3.0, shape: Cell),
        "axe": (damage: 20, interval_s: 0.4, reach_m: 3.0, shape: Cell),
    },
    hand: Some((damage: 2, interval_s: 0.35, reach_m: 3.0, shape: Cell)),
)
